{"translation-revision-date":"2026-09-14 00:00+0000","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"src\/admin\/components\/settings-panels\/LLMSTxtPanel.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"fr_FR","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n > 1);"},"Failed to save settings.":["\u00c9chec de l'enregistrement des param\u00e8tres."],"Failed to load content types. Please refresh the page.":[""],"llms.txt":[""],"Generate an llms.txt file to help AI language models understand your site content.":[""],"Learn about the llms.txt standard":[""],"Enable llms.txt":[""],"Your llms.txt is available at:":[""],"Enable to generate an llms.txt file for your site.":[""],"llms.txt enabled and files generated.":[""],"File Conflict Detected":[""],"A physical llms.txt file exists on your server. Your web server is serving this file instead of the dynamic version generated by DesignSetGo.":[""],"Failed to resolve conflict. You may need to rename or delete the file manually.":[""],"Renaming file\u2026":[""],"Use Plugin Version":[""],"The file cannot be automatically renamed. Please rename or delete it manually via FTP or your hosting file manager.":[""],"Site Description for AI":[""],"A concise summary of your site for AI language models. Leave empty to use your WordPress tagline.":[""],"characters":[""],"Content Types":[""],"Select which content types to include in llms.txt.":[""],"Excluding specific pages:":[""],"You can exclude individual pages or posts from llms.txt by editing them and toggling \"Exclude from llms.txt\" in the AI & LLMs panel.":[""],"Performance:":[""],"For performance, llms.txt includes up to 500 posts per content type. Developers can adjust this limit using the designsetgo_llms_txt_posts_limit filter.":[""],"Static Markdown Files":[""],"Generate static .md files for all your content. These files will be linked directly in llms.txt for faster access. Files are automatically regenerated when posts are saved.":[""],"Failed to generate markdown files.":[""],"Generating\u2026":[""],"Generate Markdown Files":[""],"Full Content File":[""],"Generate llms-full.txt":[""],"A single file with all your content, available at:":[""],"Generate a single comprehensive file containing all your content for deep AI ingestion.":[""],"Cache":[""],"The llms.txt file is cached for performance. Clear the cache to regenerate it with the latest content.":[""],"Cache cleared successfully.":[""],"Failed to clear cache.":[""],"Clearing\u2026":[""],"Clear Cache":[""]}}}